{"id":"ceee30b5dfc8721f","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/540_可证性逻辑_GL.md","title":"540 可证性逻辑 GL","display":"540_可证性逻辑_GL","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号与显示约定\">1. 原始符号与显示约定</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{540}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{540}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号与非原始缩写为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\bot=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad\nA\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad\n\\Box A=\\operatorname{box}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\bot=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad\nA\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad\n\\Box A=\\operatorname{box}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top:=\\neg\\bot,\\quad\nA\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B:=\\neg A\\to B,\\quad\n\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top:=\\neg\\bot,\\quad\nA\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B:=\\neg A\\to B,\\quad\n\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{540}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{540}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\">\\(\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{box}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\">\\(\\operatorname{box}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元、绑定与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变元、绑定与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{540}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{540})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{540}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{540})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{540}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{540}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{540}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{540}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{540}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{540}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{540}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{540}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{540}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{540}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{540}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{540}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{540}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{540}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{540}(\\operatorname{box}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{540}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{540}(\\operatorname{box}(A))=\\operatorname{PV}_{540}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本语言无绑定构造子，故</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{540}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{540}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{540}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,540}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{540}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{540}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{540}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,540}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中等号表示构造树相同。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-命题替换\">4. 命题替换</h1>\n<p>有限支撑替换集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{540}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{540}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{540})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{540}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{540}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{540})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{540}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{540}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{540}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{540}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{540}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{540}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{540}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{540}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{540}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{neg}(A))\n=\n\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{540}(\\sigma,A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{540}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{neg}(A))\n=\n\\operatorname{neg}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{540}(\\sigma,A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{540}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{540}(\\sigma,A),\\operatorname{Sub}_{540}(\\sigma,B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{540}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{540}(\\sigma,A),\\operatorname{Sub}_{540}(\\sigma,B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{540}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{box}(A))\n=\n\\operatorname{box}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{540}(\\sigma,A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{540}(\\sigma,\\operatorname{box}(A))\n=\n\\operatorname{box}(\\operatorname{Sub}_{540}(\\sigma,A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-公理族\">5. 公理族</h1>\n<p>命题公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{540}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{540}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{540}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{540}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{540}\n=\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{540}\n=\n\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{540}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{540}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>正规分配公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{540}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{540}\n=\n\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Löb 公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{L}^{540}\n=\n\\{\\Box(\\Box A\\to A)\\to\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{L}^{540}\n=\n\\{\\Box(\\Box A\\to A)\\to\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{540}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{540}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{540}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{540}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{540}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{540}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{L}^{540}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{540}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{540}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{540}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{540}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{540}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{540}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{L}^{540}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则\">6. 推理规则</h1>\n<p>分离与必然化分别显示为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\Box A}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\Box A}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}^{1}=\\{(A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}^{2}=\\{(A,B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}^{1}=\\{(A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}^{2}=\\{(A,B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{540}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{540}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{540}=\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{540}=\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>必然化只能作用于空依赖的较早行。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{540}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{540}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\)</span>，并且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span>，下列四项许可条件至少一项成立（外层连接为析取）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{540}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{540}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{540}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{540}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{540}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{540}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{540}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{540}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{540}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{540}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{540}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{540}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{540}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{540}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{540}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{540}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{540}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{540}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{540}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{540}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目的目标增量是 Löb 公理族</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{L}^{540}\n=\n\\{\\Box(\\Box A\\to A)\\to\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{L}^{540}\n=\n\\{\\Box(\\Box A\\to A)\\to\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>它不是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 系统，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\\to A\">\\(\\Box A\\to A\\)</span> 不作为公理族加入；它也不是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K4\">\\(K4\\)</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\\to\\Box\\Box A\">\\(\\Box A\\to\\Box\\Box A\\)</span> 不是本条目的新增公理族。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-整个句法形式系统\">10. 整个句法形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{GL}_{540}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{540},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{540},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{540},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{540},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,540},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{540},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{540},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{540},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{540},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{540},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{540},\n\\vdash_{540}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{GL}_{540}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{540},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{540},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{540},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{540},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,540},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{540},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{540},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{540},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{540},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec}^{540},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{540},\n\\vdash_{540}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含命题模态句法、替换、公理族、规则、证明对象和可证性；不含算术解释、可证性谓词、模型、框架、赋值或满足关系。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号与显示约定","text":"1. 原始符号与显示约定","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元、绑定与-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"3. 自由变元、绑定与 $\\alpha$-等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-命题替换","text":"4. 命题替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理族","text":"5. 公理族","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则","text":"6. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-整个句法形式系统","text":"10. 整个句法形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{540}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i<k\\})\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{box}.","display":true},{"tex":"p=\\operatorname{atm}(p),\\quad\n\\bot=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\quad\nA\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\quad\n\\Box A=\\operatorname{box}(A),","display":true},{"tex":"\\top:=\\neg\\bot,\\quad\nA\\land B:=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B:=\\neg A\\to B,\\quad\n\\Diamond A:=\\neg\\Box\\neg A.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{540}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{540}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\